    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1550">

                <pb facs="1251" n="1135" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1135"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.00/364.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Panama to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 4.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of Panama</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-02-05">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 5, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to inform your
                    excellency that Señor Don Rodolfo Chiari assumed on the 1st day of this month
                    the Executive Power of the Republic of Panama in his capacity as Third
                    Designado, by reason of the leave granted the First Design a do in Chargé of the
                    Executive Power, Dr. Pablo Arosemena.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ricardo Arias.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
